---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Septic System Design Laveen AZ | Diaz Environmental LLC"
  description="Septic system design, percolation testing and ADEQ permits in Laveen, AZ. Fast 3-5 day turnaround. Hablamos español. Call (602) 812-8609."
  canonical="https://diazenviroaz.com/septic-laveen-arizona"
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Septic System Services in Laveen, AZ</h1>
      <p>Expert septic design and percolation testing for Laveen and southwest Phoenix. ADEQ-certified, fast turnaround, fully bilingual.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>
    <section class="service-body">
      <h2>Septic System Design in Laveen, Arizona</h2>
      <p>Laveen is one of the fastest-growing communities in southwest Maricopa County. Despite its proximity to Phoenix, many properties in Laveen and its surrounding rural areas still rely on septic systems rather than municipal sewer. If you're building or buying in Laveen, a proper ADEQ-permitted septic system is essential.</p>

      <h2>Services We Offer in Laveen, AZ</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Site and soil evaluations</li>
        <li>Percolation testing</li>
        <li>ADEQ-approved septic system design</li>
        <li>Maricopa County permit submission</li>
        <li>Conventional and alternative system designs</li>
        <li>Septic system inspections for real estate transactions</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Fast Turnaround for Laveen Builders and Homeowners</h2>
      <p>We average 3–5 business days from soil evaluation to permit submission. As a bilingual company, we proudly serve Laveen's large Spanish-speaking community with full services in both English and Spanish.</p>

      <h2>Diseño de Sistemas Sépticos en Laveen, AZ</h2>
      <p>Ofrecemos diseño de sistemas sépticos, pruebas de percolación y trámite de permisos ADEQ en Laveen y el suroeste de Phoenix. Somos bilingües y ofrecemos los tiempos de entrega más rápidos del área. ¡Llámanos al (602) 812-8609!</p>
    </section>
    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Serving Laveen, Southwest Phoenix & Surrounding Areas</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:6028128609">(602) 812-8609</a> — same day response.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .service-page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
  .service-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .service-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #154a2a; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .service-body p { color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .service-body ul li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.5rem; position: relative; color: #444; }
  .service-body ul li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .service-cta { text-align: center; background: #f0f7f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 2rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-cta h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-cta p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] { color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: #154a2a; color: white; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #0d3019; }
</style>